\title{bulkMAE public API}
\description{
Index of stateless adapters organized as \code{<family>_<method>()} or
\code{<family>_<operation>()}. The families cover MAE access, import,
annotation, quality control, preprocessing, differential models, enrichment,
sample scoring, activity, clustering, co-expression, general networks,
deconvolution, and clinical translation.
}
\details{
Every assay-level adapter accepts an explicit MultiAssayExperiment and
experiment name. Assay scale, design, contrasts, resources, and reference data
remain explicit arguments. See the individual roxygen source blocks and the
package vignette for parameter-level documentation. Per-function Rd files
should be regenerated with roxygen2 in a complete R development environment.
}
